  "question": {
    "text": "If the incentre of an equilateral triangle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the equation of its one side is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the equation of the circumcircle of this triangle is:",
